{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2023-01-23 10:15:00', 'title': "SOLAREDGE'S TECHNOLOGY FIRST TO MEET SOUTH AUSTRALIA'S NEW DYNAMIC EXPORT REGULATIONS", 'text': "MILPITAS, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (“SOLAREDGE”) (NASDAQ: SEDG), A GLOBAL LEADER IN SMART ENERGY TECHNOLOGY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS PRODUCTS HAVE MET THE NEW DYNAMIC EXPORT REQUIREMENTS AS PART OF THE SOUTH AUSTRALIAN GOVERNMENT'S PLAN TO STABILIZE THE GRID WITH SOPHISTICATED, REMOTE CLOUD CONTROL TECHNOLOGIES. SOLAREDGE IS THE FIRST VENDOR TO CERTIFY AND OFFER THIS NATIVE DYNAMIC EXPORT SERVICE TO SA POWER NETWORK."}